孔清晰可见，细节自然，纹理细腻。\n服装设定：与参考图1人物的上身穿搭保持高度一致，下身换成紧身的牛仔裤，黑色亮面尖头细跟的高跟鞋。\n场景/环境：参考图1为场景参考，时间为夏天，充满欧洲风格，一个复古公寓的门，门打开着，旁边是复古的小店。\n动作/动态：前景有穿着时尚的行人人快速移动，动态模糊（长曝光效果）挡住部分画面和镜头。拍摄对象保持完美清晰、沉静。拍摄对象静止，轻微仰头，媚态看着镜头，（时尚杂志模特的post）位于画面的右侧。\n构图：低角度仰拍人物，全身横幅肖像，主体人物位置偏右构图，线条简洁流畅\n相机：24mm广角镜头视角，浅景深，电影感虚化效果，专业的时尚写实风格。\n光照：柔和的电影感光照，暖色调，营造氛围感。高光控制得当，阴影保留细节。\n色彩/后期：高细节，高级色彩分级，自然的肤质纹理，微妙的胶片感（无明显颗粒）。无文字、无徽标、无水印。\n画面比例『2:3』，2K HD 输出"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "JjkText", "title": "人物提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [14], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "image_url", "label": "image_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["", 1199304157, "randomize", "1:1", "4k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 12, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": 